{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"dc79d0b3-9eb8-4b5f-a5fe-ef21e86ff242","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have initiated the TypeScript check and will wait for it to finish.\nThe app has been upgraded to the current Pollar SDK (`0.12.0`) and passes `npx tsc --noEmit`. The details of all changes and note applicability have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Dependencies (`package.json`, `package-lock.json`)**:\n   - Upgraded `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0`.\n\n2. **Base URL ([`src/pollar.ts`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/pollar.ts))**:\n   - Replaced `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` with bare origin `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz'` so the SDK uses `/v3` instead of retiring `/v1`.\n\n3. **Balance Display ([`src/balances.ts`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/balances.ts))**:\n   - Handled nullable balance (`string | null`), rendering `null` as `'-'` instead of numeric `'0.00'`.\n\n4. **KYC Status ([`src/kyc.ts`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/kyc.ts))**:\n   - Added `'expired'` handling (`'Expired'`) to the status switch statement.\n\n5. **Trustline ([`src/trust.ts`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/trust.ts))**:\n   - Removed `{ sponsored: true }` parameter from [`client.setTrustline(USDC)`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/trust.ts#L6).\n\n6. **Ramp Quote ([`src/ramp.ts`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/ramp.ts))**:\n   - Replaced deprecated [`getRampsQuote`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/ramp.ts#L5) with [`quoteRamp`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/src/ramp.ts#L6) and computed the rate as `amountIn / amountOut`, returning `null` when no quote is returned.\n\n7. **Documentation ([`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/ANSWER.md))**:\n   - Created [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-2HvWN0/ANSWER.md) listing the changes and noting which parts of the colleague's note applied.\n","duration_seconds":414.875902,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":456665,"output_tokens":8759,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":4699490,"total_tokens":